# Copy to scripts/release.env and fill in values. release.env is gitignored.
#
# NewsMinus reuses credentials from NunusCursor/scripts/release.env (Chrome
# OAuth, AMO keys, Apple team + App Store Connect API key). If that file exists
# at ../nunus/NunusCursor/scripts/release.env it is loaded first; anything set
# here overrides it. Most setups need NOTHING in this file.
#
# Check what's missing:
#   ./scripts/check-release-credentials.sh

# --- Chrome Web Store (NewsMinus listing) ---
# https://chromewebstore.google.com/detail/nytimes-cleaner/hkiiglaagokcdpagbblfhmdobblfelpn
# CWS_EXTENSION_ID=hkiiglaagokcdpagbblfhmdobblfelpn
# OAuth (usually inherited from Nunus release.env):
# CWS_CLIENT_ID=
# CWS_CLIENT_SECRET=
# CWS_REFRESH_TOKEN=

# --- Firefox AMO ---
# AMO_JWT_ISSUER=
# AMO_JWT_SECRET=
# AMO_ADDON_ID=nytimescleaner@nunus.extension
# AMO_CHANNEL=listed

# --- Apple App Store (Safari, macOS + iOS) ---
# Team + API key usually inherited from Nunus release.env:
# APPLE_TEAM_ID=
# APP_STORE_CONNECT_API_KEY_ID=
# APP_STORE_CONNECT_ISSUER_ID=
# APP_STORE_CONNECT_API_KEY_PATH=/path/to/AuthKey_XXXXXX.p8
# Fallback if you do not use an API key:
# APPLE_ID=you@example.com
# APPLE_APP_SPECIFIC_PASSWORD=
#
# NewsMinus-specific Apple IDs are pinned by scripts/lib/load-release-env.sh
# (values in the shared Nunus env never leak). Override only via NEWSMINUS_*:
# NEWSMINUS_MACOS_BUNDLE_ID=com.nunus.NYTimesCleanerHost
# NEWSMINUS_IOS_BUNDLE_ID=com.nunus.NYTimesCleanerHost.ios
# NEWSMINUS_IOS_EXT_BUNDLE_ID=com.nunus.NYTimesCleanerHost.ios.extension
# NEWSMINUS_IOS_HOST_PROFILE=NewsMinus iOS App Store
# NEWSMINUS_IOS_EXT_PROFILE=NewsMinus iOS Extension App Store
#
# iOS ships as a SEPARATE App Store app, included by default in
# publish-stores.sh. Skip with --no-ios or:
# PUBLISH_INCLUDE_IOS=0
#
# iOS signing: the Apple Distribution .p12 is shared with Nunus. Local copy at
# scripts/keys/ios-signing/dist.p12 wins; otherwise
# ../nunus/NunusCursor/scripts/keys/ios-signing/dist.p12 is used. Overrides:
# IOS_SIGN_P12=/path/to/dist.p12
# IOS_SIGN_P12_PW=

# --- App Store submit options ---
# APP_STORE_SKIP_SUBMIT=1                 # upload only; submit manually in ASC
# APP_STORE_WHATS_NEW=Bug fixes and improvements.
# APP_STORE_WHATS_NEW_FILE=/path/to/whats-new.txt
# APP_STORE_LOCALE=en-US
# APP_STORE_BUILD_WAIT_MINUTES=45
# APP_STORE_AUTO_RELEASE=1                # publishCheck auto-releases approved versions
# Listing description synced before submit (default docs/description.md):
# STORE_DESCRIPTION_FILE=/path/to/description.md

# --- Optional overrides ---
# NEWSMINUS_RELEASE_ENV=/path/to/custom/release.env
# NUNUS_RELEASE_ENV=/path/to/nunus/NunusCursor/scripts/release.env
